2 0 obj
<<
/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Attention\054\040learn\040to\040solve\040routing\040problems\041)
/Author (Wouter\040Kool\054\040Herke\040van\040Hoof\054\040Max\040Welling)
/Subject (The\040recently\040presented\040idea\040to\040learn\040heuristics\040for\040combinatorial\040optimization\040problems\040is\040promising\040as\040it\040can\040save\040costly\040development\056\040However\054\040to\040push\040this\040idea\040towards\040practical\040implementation\054\040we\040need\040better\040models\040and\040better\040ways\040of\040training\056\040We\040contribute\040in\040both\040directions\072\040we\040propose\040a\040model\040based\040on\040attention\040layers\040with\040benefits\040over\040the\040Pointer\040Network\040and\040we\040show\040how\040to\040train\040this\040model\040using\040REINFORCE\040with\040a\040simple\040baseline\040based\040on\040a\040deterministic\040greedy\040rollout\054\040which\040we\040find\040is\040more\040efficient\040than\040using\040a\040value\040function\056\040We\040significantly\040improve\040over\040recent\040learned\040heuristics\040for\040the\040Travelling\040Salesman\040Problem\040\050TSP\051\054\040getting\040close\040to\040optimal\040results\040for\040problems\040up\040to\040100\040nodes\056\040With\040the\040same\040hyperparameters\054\040we\040learn\040strong\040heuristics\040for\040two\040variants\040of\040the\040Vehicle\040Routing\040Problem\040\050VRP\051\054\040the\040Orienteering\040Problem\040\050OP\051\040and\040\050a\040stochastic\040variant\040of\051\040the\040Prize\040Collecting\040TSP\040\050PCTSP\051\054\040outperforming\040a\040wide\040range\040of\040baselines\040and\040getting\040results\040close\040to\040highly\040optimized\040and\040specialized\040algorithms\056)
/Keywords (07\040Feb\0402019\054\040International\040Conference\040on\040Learning\040Representations\054\040Heuristics\054\040Vehicle\040routing\040problem\054\040Travelling\040salesman\040problem\054\040Harvard\040University\054\040University\040of\040Amsterdam)
>>
endobj
